\cf2 \'93It was poly-cotton," her friend said. "That's what did it. The cotton takes hold and the poly won't let go of you.\'94\
\'93My blouse was pure cotton.\'94\
\'93Don\'92t give me that, girl. Our families couldn\'92t afford pure cotton.\'94\
\'93My momma saved for months for that blouse. I was so happy when she handed it down to me. It was cotton.\'94\
\'93You weren\'92t even there,\'94 Maile said.\
Even so faded, Kathy could see the colour was not even along it\'97paler in places, and the places had edges. She said nothing. \'93When did you notice the scar healing?\'94\
